    "referenceCode": "char\t*ft_strrev(char *str)\n{\n\tint\tlen;\n\tint\ti;\n\tchar\ttmp;\n\n\tlen = 0;\n\ti = 0;\n\twhile (str[len])\n\t\tlen++;\n\tlen -= 1;\n\twhile (i < len)\n\t{\n\t\ttmp = str[i];\n\t\tstr[i] = str[len];\n\t\tstr[len] = tmp;\n\t\ti++;\n\t\tlen--;\n\t}\n\treturn (str);\n}\n",
    "mainCode": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nchar\t*ft_strrev(char *str);\n\nint\tmain(int ac, char **argv)\n{\n\tchar *s = argv[1];\n\tft_strrev(s);\n\tprintf(\"%s\\n\", s);\n\treturn (0);\n}\n",
